    "url": "https://www.dnronline.com/associated_press/national/bryan-kohberger-asks-to-withdraw-his-guilty-plea-in-the-university-of-idaho-murders-case/article_e9181403-e7fe-5da7-b86b-57f10bf11c29.html",
